| Em7    | Gm6    | F#m7   | B7sus4 - B7 |
| Em7    | A7     | A/D - D | DM7    |

lyric:
To hold your hand and call you mine; I'm tryna be your man, 'til the end of time
Oh, I'll do anything, anything you ask me to
I would run through a fire; Just to be by your side; If your heart's on the line; You could take mine
It's crazy, but it's true; There's nothing I won't do; I'd risk it all for you

